  (116, 'Spirit of Toulouse', '1083463', '412437650', 'France', 'Ro-Ro', 2026, 5300, 19021, 168, 23.3, 'Rotor Sail', 'Norsepower', 'Finland', 2026, 6, 35, 'm', 'Newbuild', 'Wuchang Shipbuilding', NULL, 'Louis Dreyfus', 'Louis Dreyfus', 'Active', 'First of three methanol dual-fuel Ro-Ros chartered to Airbus (sisters Spirit of Mobile, Spirit of Mirabel), Saint-Nazaire - Mobile, Alabama. Deltamarin design, BV class. Launched Feb 2026 at Wuchang; six 35 m x 5 m Norsepower rotors being fitted in Shanghai from 10 Sep 2026 (2 of 6 up at last report), then sea trials; delivery expected Oct 2026. Install yard left blank: sources say only ''in Shanghai''. Not yet delivered when added (9 Oct 2026). AIS shows a Chinese trials MMSI (412437650); expect a French MMSI after delivery - VERIFY. DWT is VesselFinder''s figure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.myshiptracking.com/vessels/spirit-of-toulouse-mmsi-412437650-imo-1083463', 'https://www.vesselfinder.com/vessels/details/1083463', NULL, NULL),
